WEBVTT

00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:15,220
I received my model of clear hist and clear CV today and see that they both been reformulated.

00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,820
Can you tell me about the changes in why they were done?

00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:28,260
So the clear CV we wanted to add vitamin A to it because the synergistic effects of

00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:35,700
those things for clear CV to help with with colds and viruses was just missing vitamin A.

00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:40,660
So we switched it to add vitamin A. So that's really the only difference in clear CV.

00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:49,060
The clear hist formula is a little bit different because we just went to we switched to a

00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:56,180
different company with that that I was happier with with the total product itself. So the clear

00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:03,220
hist there's more it's a similar product but there's more changes to it. I just think it's a much

00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:08,260
better product. We're always just searching to get to give you the best products especially

00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:18,180
products that have our names on it. We want the best product out there.

